[chained-comparison] Error: comparisons cannot be chained
   ╭─[ example.vaab:1:22 ]
   │
 1 │ let ok = low < value < high
   │                      ┬  
   │                      ╰── this `<` compares the result of the comparison before it
   │ 
   │ Help: write the two comparisons separately, joined with `and`
   │ 
   │ Note: for example, `low < value and value < high`
───╯
